{
 "n": 10,
 "title": "Formations: where everyone lines up, and what it tells you",
 "html": "<p><strong>Personnel (Lesson 1) is <em>who</em> is on the field. Formation is <em>where</em> they stand.</strong> The same 11 players can line up many ways. Two things define a formation: where the QB stands (under center or back in shotgun), and how the receivers are spread.</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 166\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"QB under center, 3 backs in a row behind him, no wide receivers\"><defs><marker id=\"m29w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m29y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"76\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"79.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"108\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"111.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"108\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"111.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">FB</text><circle cx=\"244\" cy=\"108\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"244\" y=\"111.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">QB under center, 3 backs in a row behind him, no wide receivers</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>T formation.</strong> The original modern formation from the 1940s. Three backs in a line behind the QB, so the run can go to either side and the defense can’t tell which back gets the ball. Today you see it at the goal line, where it’s called \"full house.\"</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 166\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"QB under center, FB and RB stacked straight behind him\"><defs><marker id=\"m30w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m30y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"76\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"79.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"102\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"105.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">FB</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"128\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"131.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">QB under center, FB and RB stacked straight behind him</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>I-formation.</strong> The T with the backs stacked in a straight line. The FB leads, the RB follows him through the hole. Power running; also great for play-action.</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 166\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"QB under center, one back deep behind him\"><defs><marker id=\"m31w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m31y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"60\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"63.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"76\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"79.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"120\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"123.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">QB under center, one back deep behind him</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Singleback.</strong> One back behind a QB under center. Balanced: run or pass equally.</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 166\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"QB about 5 yards back, RB beside him\"><defs><marker id=\"m32w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m32y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"60\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"63.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"102\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"105.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"234\" cy=\"102\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"234\" y=\"105.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">QB about 5 yards back, RB beside him</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Shotgun.</strong> The QB starts 5 yards back, so he sees the defense and doesn’t need to drop back. The most common NFL alignment; leans pass but runs plenty.</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 166\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"QB about 4 yards back, RB directly behind him\"><defs><marker id=\"m33w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m33y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"60\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"63.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"86\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"89.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"122\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"125.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">QB about 4 yards back, RB directly behind him</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Pistol.</strong> A short shotgun with the RB directly behind. The run can go either way, and the QB can run too. Common in college.</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 166\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"three receivers to one side (3x1)\"><defs><marker id=\"m34w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m34y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"60\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"63.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"336\" cy=\"64\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"67.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"102\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"105.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"102\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"105.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><path d=\"M290 84 h92\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"98\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">3 receivers</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">three receivers to one side (3x1)</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Trips (3x1).</strong> Three receivers to one side. It forces the defense to shift coverage that way, which often leaves the lone receiver on the other side one-on-one.</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 166\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"three receivers in a tight triangle\"><defs><marker id=\"m35w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m35y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"292\" cy=\"74\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"292\" y=\"77.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"328\" cy=\"74\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"328\" y=\"77.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"102\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"105.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"102\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"105.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">three receivers in a tight triangle</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Bunch.</strong> Three receivers in a tight triangle. Built to beat man coverage (Lesson 9).</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 166\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"no one in the backfield: all 5 are receivers\"><defs><marker id=\"m36w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m36y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"60\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"63.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"60\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"63.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"59.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"54\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"57.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"102\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"105.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"84\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">RB split out</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"158\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">no one in the backfield: all 5 are receivers</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Empty.</strong> No back behind the QB: everyone is a receiver. Almost always a pass, and a quick one, since there’s no back to block a blitzer.</p>\n<p><strong>Connecting it:</strong> the closer the QB and backs are to the line and to each other (T, I), the more the offense wants to run. The more spread out everyone is (shotgun, trips, empty), the more it wants to pass. The defense reads this the same way, which is exactly why offenses sometimes run from empty or throw from the I.</p>\n<p class=\"note\">Next: the two-minute drill, and why the clock changes everything late in a half.</p>",
